<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ SPORT-Cricket-Canterbury beats Wgtn by 123 runs.</title>
<headline>NZ SPORT-Cricket-Canterbury beats Wgtn by 123 runs.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canterbury slaughtered Wellington by 123 runs in the Shell Cup limited overs cricket final at the Basin Reserve on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Canterbury, batting first, scored 204 and bowled out Wellington for 81.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
